  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\">最佳PVP材質包</strong></span></span></h1>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>英文版</strong></span></h2>\n<p><strong>本材質包包含專業PVP所需的一切元素。</strong><br>\n<strong>使用後將大幅提升你的技術，同時獲得更高FPS和更低延遲。</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>包含內容：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>炫彩鑽石劍</strong></li>\n<li><strong>優化盔甲</strong></li>\n<li><strong>閃耀鑽石裝</strong></li>\n<li><strong>專業金蘋果</strong></li>\n<li><strong>縮小盾牌</strong></li>\n<li><strong>簡化火焰</strong></li>\n<li><strong>精簡非必要物品</strong></li>\n<li><strong>隱形不死圖騰</strong></li>\n<li><strong>改良羊毛</strong></li>\n<li><strong>+FPS提升</strong></li>\n<li><strong>-減少延遲</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>&nbsp; 作者 @d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"></p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>西班牙文版</strong></span></h2>\n<p><strong>（此處保留原文西班牙文內容不翻譯）</strong></p>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>❤️ 支持作者 ❤️</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/wURmd9P3qq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"Discord社群\" width=\"163\" height=\"56\"></a>&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/donate-me-126284950?utm_medium=clipboard_copy&amp;utm_source=copyLink&amp;utm_campaign=postshare_creator&amp;utm_content=join_link\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/patreon.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon贊助\" width=\"180\" height=\"56\"></a>&nbsp; \n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540texturepacks_mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"h